N2  - The Abdominal Acupuncture (AA) system is an innovatory microsystem based on traditional acupuncture meridian theory. AA theory proposes that the Abdominal Meridian System (AMS) with Shenque REN-8 at its centre forms the fundamental regulating system of the human body. This article explores the basic theory and methods of AA, and is illustrated with two case histories from the author's own practice.
