N2  - Prof. Zhang An-li's clinical experiences on treatment of intractable facial paralysis are introduced. According to own many year's clinical experiences and in combination with modified heat-producing needling and fire needle therapy, Prof. Zhang summarized and created superficially needling the upper eye lid, needling Back-shu points and balance acupoint selection, and other methods to treat intractable facial paralysis, attaining clinically obvious therapeutic effect.
