N2  - Aim: To explore a substitute of autologous nerve graft in repairing facial nerve short distance defect with autologous non-neural tissues material, inversion vein-skeletal muscles graft, and observe its therapeutic efficacy. Methods: The experiment was done in the Animal Laboratory of Peking Union Medical Hospital, Electric Physical Laboratory of Department of Otorhinolaryngology and Pathological Laboratory of Department of Psychiatry. Ten male New Zealand rabbits were selected and randomly divided into inversion vein-skeletal muscles cograft group and self nerve grafting group with 5 rabbits in each group. The skeletal muscles cograft body filled in self internal and external surface inversion vein and self nerve grafting recovered the right side on nerve upper buccal branches 10 mm defection. The effect of the two kinds of recovery methods was compared. Amplitude and incubation of maximum compound muscles action potential on experimental side/normal side observed the functional restoration of regeneration nerve. The constitution form recovery of regeneration nerve was analyzed by constitution form observation and axis-cylinder with marrow. The appearance of facial paralysis and its recovery's condition was judged from external appearance according to the symmetry of labrum, cirrus, form and activity of nasal apex on the two sides. Results: According to actual treat analysis, totally 10 rabbits were involved in the result analysis with 5 in each group. 1 The functional restoration and constitution form restoration of regeneration nerve in the two groups: The amplitude of vibration ratio of maximum compound muscles action potential on experimental side/normal side in inversion vein-skeletal muscles cograft group was 103%, 93%, 80%, 59% and 50% respectively; The ratio of incubation of normal side/ experimental side was 67%, 75%, 115%, 62% and 50% respectively; The recovery ratio of fiber with marrow was 63%, 68%, 96%, 39% and 30% respectively. The amplitude of vibration ratio of maximum compound muscles action potential on experimental side/normal side in self nerve grafting group was 99%, 95%, 78%, 64% and 53% respectively; The ratio of incubation of experimental side/ normal side was 78%, 100%, 80%, 75% and 67%, respectively; The recovery ratio of fiber with marrow was 71%, 62%, 47%, 53% and 51%, respectively. Through the independent sample t-test, The recovery degree of regeneration nerve function (the ratio of amplitude of vibration, the ratio of incubation period) and the recovery ratio of fiber with marrow in the two groups were similar (t =0.05, P=0.961; t =0.509,P =0.624;t= -0.22, P=0.832), which indicated the equal functional and ntal morphological recovery of the regenerating nerves. The recovery degree of regeneration nerve function and the quantity of regeneration axis-cylinder with marrow were not complete coincidence, and the effect of nerve regeneration should not be evaluated purely by the quantity of axis-cylinder with marrow. If there were a large number of axis-cylinder with marrow, the form was similar with the normal nerve, besides, when many big intensive order relatively fasciculus were formed, the functional restoration was better sometimes. 2 The recovery of facial paralysis and the nerve healing condition: There were recovery in different degree on facial paralysis of the animals in the two groups, and the recovery was significant over half of them, and two rabbits in every group recovered normally. The remove parts in the two groups were all healing with the two broken end of neurologic defect, and recover the continuity of nerve. Conclusion: The recovery of facial short distance injury in inversion vein-skeletal muscles cograft can gain the same effect with autologous nerve grafting, which is the ideal materials and methods to replace the recovery of short distance nerve injury with autologous nerve grafting.
