N2  - The otites, especially Acute Otitis Media, are diseases that occur in all ages, mainly in childhood, and extremely frequent at usual clinical practice. We present the physiopathological and microbiological aspects, clinical findings, complications and treatment of the several clinical forms, such as the complications, that must be known by all physicians to avoid the sequels caused by this disease.
