N2  - Objective: Study on treated effect of neurotic function defect and treated mechanism of multipolar brain refltex instrument for serious brain injury. Methods: The patients were randomly divided into 2 groups: treated group were treated by multipolar brain refltex instrument. The statistics analysis and study were putted in average value of summation, consciousness, level fix function, facial paralysis, language, muscle force of upper limbs, muscle force of hands, muscle force of lower limbs and walking ability. Result: The consciousness, language, muscle force of upper and lower limbs had obvious ameliorated, average values of score were prominent decrease (P < 0.05) after treatment. Conclusion: Multipolar brain reflex instrument have finer curative effect on symptom of neurotic function which the patients of serious brain injury have produced defect especially in the consciousness, limbs activity and language.
