N2  - A single case study of a patient with 25 years of facial immobility from Parkinson's disease (PD) treated with Yin Tui Na on his right foot followed by acupuncture on the right foot. Full facial expression returned. Also a brief survey of changes in facial expression in a group of forty two subjects with PD, twenty three of whom could not smile before treatment, and all of whom could smile following foot treatment with Yin Tui Na and, in many cases, foot acupuncture.
