N2  - A rare case of penetrating foreign body causing immediate facial nerve palsy in a young adult is reported. Patient required extraction of foreign body and facial nerve decompression. The nerve was damaged in the region of the geniculate ganglion by impacted wooden spicules. Gradual recovery was seen after nerve decompression.
