N2  - A total of 28 patients with tumors of basis cranii were examined and treated between may, 1995 and april, 1988. Most informative methods of diagnosis and treatment of the tumors of this localization were pointed out. The surgical method with using the combined transcervical-transmastoidal approach is the method of choice for the treatment. 16 patients were operated. In the case of affected facial nerve the neuroplastics VII-XII is indicated at final step of the operation. Long-term (within 6 months, 1 and 2 years after the treatment) results were depicted.
