N2  - The authors report a case of hypertrophy of the upper lip with facial paralysis and scrotal tongue in a 25-year-old white man. It was diagnosed according to clinical and histopathological aspects as Melkersson-Rosenthal syndrome. The patient was treated with clofazimine, 100 mg daily during ten days followed by 200 mg, twice a week, during three months, obtaining good results.
