N2  - We report on a 17-year-old Japanese boy with Mobius sequence, peripheral neuropathy, and hypogonadotropic hypogonadism, the fourth such case known to us. The association of peripheral neuropathy and hypogonadotropic hypogonadism in Mobius sequence seems to be more than coincidence. Pulsatile gonadotropin-releasing hormone administration for 3 months showed the effectiveness of this treatment for this patient.
