N2  - Facial paralysis is a complex treatment problem. The author has developed some innovative treatment techniques based on the Chain Relationship of Nerve Centers, Body Surfaces and International Organs, which is also known as the Meridian Theory of Nerve Reaction. Using this theory and depending upon the pathological anatomy and disturbed physiology of the neurologic lesion, various new acupuncture points, the 'Proper Union Points' and other sites are used to succesfully treat this affliction.
